WEBVTT

00:07.200 --> 00:08.920
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:35.360 --> 01:38.920
‎ADAPTED FROM ‎JIA JIN CHAI‎, ORIGINAL NOVEL
‎BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:43.040 --> 01:44.280
My Lady, you've been gone so long.

01:44.360 --> 01:46.000
I've come to welcome you home.

01:46.080 --> 01:47.040
What's so urgent?

01:47.120 --> 01:48.920
The silkworm house
has been fully thatched.

01:49.000 --> 01:50.520
We're all waiting for you to return.

01:50.600 --> 01:54.120
By custom, the owner must be the first
to enter a newly built house.

01:56.880 --> 01:57.720
Look out!

01:59.560 --> 02:00.520
Protect Her Ladyship!

02:42.240 --> 02:43.160
Go! Now!

03:13.560 --> 03:17.280
Your Ladyship, you promised me.

03:18.520 --> 03:19.800
You said you'd forgiven me.

03:19.880 --> 03:23.600
I haven't. I hold grudges.

03:24.280 --> 03:25.680
You have to keep being good to me.

03:25.760 --> 03:27.000
You have to stay by my side.

03:27.080 --> 03:28.640
Only then will I forgive you.

03:28.720 --> 03:29.760
Bitao…

03:33.360 --> 03:36.080
You've suffered so much, My Lady.

03:37.320 --> 03:39.080
So much.

03:40.120 --> 03:45.680
Your adoptive mother, your birth mother,
and the Wei family.

03:45.760 --> 03:48.160
They've all been so cruel to you.

03:51.080 --> 03:53.240
And so have I.

03:54.520 --> 03:58.400
For my own selfish reasons,
I betrayed you.

03:59.120 --> 04:00.640
No, you didn't, Bitao.

04:00.720 --> 04:03.000
You're different. You're not like them.

04:04.000 --> 04:07.680
Those people never treated us as human.

04:09.600 --> 04:15.880
Every time I saw you win,
it felt so, so good.

04:23.480 --> 04:27.120
Don't look back. Keep climbing.

04:27.680 --> 04:30.000
Fight your way to the top.

04:33.840 --> 04:39.680
Everyone who's mocked you
will one day grovel at your feet.

04:40.400 --> 04:42.360
I will.

04:42.440 --> 04:45.040
No one can stand in your way.

04:48.440 --> 04:50.240
I can't bear to go.

04:51.000 --> 04:53.560
I wanted to see it for myself.

04:53.640 --> 04:55.200
To see your future…

04:55.960 --> 04:58.480
-Your future…
-I'll make it happen. I will.

05:06.880 --> 05:07.720
Bitao…

05:09.440 --> 05:10.280
Bitao.

05:12.040 --> 05:13.480
Bitao!

05:20.960 --> 05:21.840
Bitao.

05:25.040 --> 05:25.920
Bitao.

05:27.520 --> 05:28.960
-Bitao…
-Rao!

05:40.040 --> 05:41.040
-My lady.
-Bitao!

05:41.560 --> 05:42.400
Your Ladyship.

05:42.480 --> 05:44.360
Bitao!

05:45.400 --> 05:47.640
Bitao!

06:06.160 --> 06:08.920
ZHUYU ESTATE

06:14.480 --> 06:15.600
My Lady, you've been gone so long.

06:15.680 --> 06:17.480
I've come to welcome you home.

06:20.160 --> 06:21.040
Bitao!

06:23.960 --> 06:25.840
Wei Rao, you're awake.

06:27.120 --> 06:28.280
Those bandits…

06:29.280 --> 06:31.280
-Have they been caught?
-We caught them all.

06:31.360 --> 06:34.000
We used severe measures. They confessed
as bandits from the South Mountain

06:35.600 --> 06:36.960
who had come seeking revenge.

06:38.080 --> 06:39.880
I've sent men to escort
the Fourth Prince back to the palace.

06:40.400 --> 06:41.320
As for your maid,

06:42.360 --> 06:44.000
I've had someone arrange her funeral.

06:48.680 --> 06:50.080
Thank you, General Qi.

06:50.680 --> 06:51.920
Wei Rao, in fact…

06:52.000 --> 06:55.160
General Qi, I'd like some time alone.

06:58.080 --> 06:59.120
I'll leave you, then.

07:03.120 --> 07:05.280
If you need anything, let me know.

07:11.800 --> 07:13.200
You two may leave too.

07:20.280 --> 07:21.560
‎ADORNED WITH AUTUMN'S FRAGRANCE

08:00.240 --> 08:01.680
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

08:33.880 --> 08:35.400
Has Her Ladyship stayed
in her room all this time?

08:35.480 --> 08:38.159
She won't come out or see any visitors.

08:38.240 --> 08:39.799
FLOURISHING LIKE THE PINES

08:39.880 --> 08:41.000
You saw it yourself.

08:41.080 --> 08:42.720
She even turned away Lady Li's people.

08:42.799 --> 08:44.760
No matter what we say,
she refuses to see anyone.

08:45.560 --> 08:46.640
What do we do?

08:57.080 --> 08:59.120
I'll make her want
to come out of that room.

09:17.360 --> 09:19.160
Hurry!

09:19.240 --> 09:21.920
At this time of year,
there's plenty to do on the estate.

09:22.000 --> 09:24.200
-How can you hide in here, lazing about?
-Grandmother, what brings you here?

09:24.800 --> 09:27.440
Come on! We'll be too late!

09:27.520 --> 09:30.440
-Where are we going? Too late for what?
-Come along. Follow me.

09:30.960 --> 09:34.080
-The fields need work in winter too.
-Take it slow.

09:34.600 --> 09:35.800
Before the snow comes,

09:35.880 --> 09:38.280
you must plow this entire stretch of land
nice and deep.

09:38.960 --> 09:41.600
Cover the vegetable beds
and wheat rows with straw.

09:41.680 --> 09:43.040
The tools have been used all year,

09:43.120 --> 09:44.680
-so get them repaired too.
-Turn the soil over there again.

09:44.760 --> 09:45.840
-What's real hardship?
-All right.

09:45.920 --> 09:46.520
Let's go.

09:46.600 --> 09:48.560
An empty stomach. That's hardship.

09:48.640 --> 09:49.680
Give the people

09:49.760 --> 09:53.000
a decent year and a good harvest,

09:53.080 --> 09:55.960
and they'll have smiles on their faces.

09:56.560 --> 09:59.200
There are over a thousand mouths to feed

09:59.280 --> 10:01.400
in and around this estate.

10:02.080 --> 10:04.560
Just spend a few days

10:04.640 --> 10:05.920
working in the fields.

10:06.000 --> 10:09.280
-I guarantee you have no time to be sad.
-Those lands are done.

10:10.160 --> 10:13.600
Food and land are our real lifeblood.

10:14.760 --> 10:15.960
Over here.

10:16.040 --> 10:17.000
Come.

10:17.520 --> 10:19.160
This is hard physical work.

10:19.240 --> 10:20.440
Can you manage it?

10:20.520 --> 10:23.800
I've done all kinds of backbreaking work,
but I've never worked the fields.

10:24.440 --> 10:26.320
We used to be too poor to own any land.

10:27.320 --> 10:28.400
But I promise you, Grandmother,

10:28.480 --> 10:29.920
I'll work hard.

10:30.600 --> 10:33.200
-Good. Get to work.
-We're not done yet.

10:33.280 --> 10:34.320
Here, give it to me.

10:37.440 --> 10:39.000
-Bring the ox over!
-Let's move.

10:40.240 --> 10:41.240
All right!

10:53.840 --> 10:55.160
This is good soil.

10:55.960 --> 10:57.400
Turn it over again.

11:04.360 --> 11:05.360
Lady Shou'an.

11:09.440 --> 11:11.560
Lord Lu, what brings you here?

11:12.080 --> 11:13.280
Have your wounds healed?

11:13.880 --> 11:14.920
I happened to be passing by.

11:15.440 --> 11:17.160
-Thanks to Imperial Physician Liu,
-Turn it over again.

11:17.240 --> 11:18.160
I'm much better now.

11:18.240 --> 11:19.160
Come.

11:19.240 --> 11:20.520
This one?

11:20.600 --> 11:21.280
Give me a hand.

11:23.320 --> 11:24.600
You shouldn't be doing this.

11:24.680 --> 11:25.560
Let me help.

11:25.640 --> 11:28.840
No, leading the ox is easy enough.

11:29.440 --> 11:32.560
If you really want to help,

11:34.800 --> 11:36.160
go plow the field.

11:37.320 --> 11:38.560
All right.

11:39.920 --> 11:41.240
Give it to me.

11:43.840 --> 11:44.880
I wouldn't dare trouble you, My Lord.

11:45.560 --> 11:46.520
Afraid my wounds haven't healed?

11:47.720 --> 11:48.520
-What's this?
-Hold it steady.

11:48.600 --> 11:50.000
-All right.
-Are you worried about me?

11:50.080 --> 11:51.760
Put it here.

11:54.040 --> 11:56.560
Since you're so eager to help,
you can handle the plow.

11:57.360 --> 11:59.120
I've seen others drive
the ox and plow at the same time.

11:59.760 --> 12:01.160
With your martial skills,

12:01.240 --> 12:02.960
a little task like this
should be no challenge.

12:03.040 --> 12:05.080
I'm flattered.

12:05.160 --> 12:06.480
I won't disappoint you.

12:10.640 --> 12:14.560
Surely you know the field
must be cleared before plowing, right?

12:14.640 --> 12:17.560
I'll leave the weeds and stones
for you to clear away.

12:20.840 --> 12:21.840
Bring me a basket.

12:29.720 --> 12:31.240
I really am getting old.

12:31.320 --> 12:32.600
I'll leave you two to it.

12:33.200 --> 12:34.640
Work hard. No slacking.

12:34.720 --> 12:36.000
Come.

12:39.080 --> 12:40.040
Grandmother…

12:44.960 --> 12:45.800
Over here.

12:48.000 --> 12:48.840
Come.

12:49.720 --> 12:50.760
Be careful.

13:00.760 --> 13:02.400
Turn the soil over here again!

13:07.760 --> 13:08.600
Some more?

13:11.440 --> 13:12.320
Come.

13:12.400 --> 13:13.560
Coming!

13:15.200 --> 13:16.040
Careful!

13:20.760 --> 13:21.800
Be careful.

13:23.880 --> 13:24.960
Did you ask Grandmother to come?

13:26.360 --> 13:32.720
Lu Zhuo, you said it yourself
that our marriage was a mistake.

13:32.800 --> 13:33.800
The sooner we ended it, the better.

13:34.400 --> 13:35.720
I've changed my mind.

13:36.560 --> 13:37.600
You're going back on your word?

13:39.400 --> 13:42.640
Back then, I risked my life
to clear obstacles for you.

13:43.560 --> 13:46.120
You swore you'd repay my kindness.

13:47.440 --> 13:48.960
Now you've turned your back on me.

13:49.040 --> 13:52.080
Who's really going back on their word?

13:52.160 --> 13:53.360
You…

14:12.480 --> 14:17.600
AS THE SUN RISES

14:17.680 --> 14:18.800
You must be exhausted.

14:23.040 --> 14:26.600
Now I really understand
why you don't like Lu Zhuo.

14:26.680 --> 14:31.400
While you were there,
he worked so hard at plowing.

14:31.480 --> 14:34.640
The moment you left,
he found an excuse and slipped away.

14:35.360 --> 14:38.080
My poor old back nearly broke.

14:41.640 --> 14:42.480
You don't believe me?

14:43.080 --> 14:45.680
Lu Zhuo is stubborn and keeps his word.

14:45.760 --> 14:47.240
He wouldn't leave a job half done.

14:47.760 --> 14:49.160
You're just teasing him.

14:49.240 --> 14:51.120
That's right!

14:51.200 --> 14:54.160
He really did work hard.

14:54.240 --> 14:56.320
He plowed the field and harrowed it too.

14:56.400 --> 14:59.960
Anyone watching would have taken him
for one of our tenant farmers.

15:00.520 --> 15:02.400
Come.

15:05.520 --> 15:06.360
Look.

15:11.240 --> 15:13.080
Where did you find such an adorable puppy?

15:13.160 --> 15:15.800
Lord Lu gave it to me.

15:15.880 --> 15:17.800
Of course it's adorable.

15:23.360 --> 15:25.720
How could you accept a gift from him?

15:25.800 --> 15:27.040
You know perfectly well…

15:27.720 --> 15:29.440
I don't know anything.

15:29.520 --> 15:32.680
I just know that a young man
gave me this lovely little dog.

15:33.320 --> 15:36.120
Besides, he gave it to me, not you.

15:36.200 --> 15:37.960
What's bothering you?

15:38.040 --> 15:41.480
So you'd sell out
your own granddaughter for a puppy?

15:41.560 --> 15:42.400
Never.

15:42.480 --> 15:47.760
Even a mountain of gold
wouldn't be worth as much as you.

15:48.680 --> 15:50.120
As for Lord Lu,

15:50.200 --> 15:54.400
don't let him sweet-talk you
into getting back together with him.

15:54.480 --> 15:56.720
What's so great about presiding
over the Lu household?

15:56.800 --> 16:00.520
If you ask me, if you want to marry again,

16:01.120 --> 16:03.040
take a husband into your own household.

16:03.120 --> 16:05.320
Choose someone young and handsome.

16:05.400 --> 16:06.280
Wouldn't that be 100 times better

16:06.360 --> 16:08.520
than marrying
into some great noble family?

16:08.600 --> 16:09.880
I'm in no mood to think about that.

16:26.160 --> 16:27.320
Then what are you thinking about?

16:28.000 --> 16:28.960
Revenge?

16:34.440 --> 16:35.280
You know?

16:35.360 --> 16:37.600
Anyone with eyes can see it.

16:37.680 --> 16:38.880
But don't even think about it.

16:39.480 --> 16:44.560
She may lack virtue and intelligence
and be narrow-minded and despicable,

16:44.640 --> 16:46.480
but she belongs to the Han clan.

16:47.000 --> 16:49.120
So does the Empress Dowager.

16:49.760 --> 16:50.880
For that reason alone,

16:50.960 --> 16:52.800
His Majesty would never
depose the Empress.

16:55.360 --> 16:56.200
My child,

16:57.200 --> 17:01.280
I know you've suffered so many wrongs.

17:01.360 --> 17:06.160
But for now, you mustn't think of revenge.

17:08.000 --> 17:09.599
Promise me, will you?

17:20.839 --> 17:21.960
I'll do as you say.

17:36.680 --> 17:39.520
ZHUYU ESTATE

17:41.960 --> 17:44.120
Lord Lu, that was thoughtful of you.

17:44.200 --> 17:46.360
Thank you for coming
to Xianzhuang to let me know.

17:46.440 --> 17:50.920
You're wise and worldly, Lady Shou'an.
Wei Rao respects you deeply.

17:51.520 --> 17:53.240
Only you can talk sense into her.

17:53.760 --> 17:55.200
I should be thanking you.

17:55.720 --> 17:57.160
I'm not so sure.

17:57.240 --> 17:58.800
Ever since childhood,

17:58.880 --> 18:02.000
Rao has endured hardship
and faced so much scorn.

18:02.600 --> 18:06.120
Naturally, she's learned
to hide her feelings.

18:07.080 --> 18:10.000
I'm afraid she'll say one thing
and do another.

18:10.680 --> 18:12.040
I'll keep an eye on her.

18:12.120 --> 18:15.080
Lord Lu, have you really
thought this through?

18:15.160 --> 18:16.840
This won't be an easy path.

18:17.440 --> 18:19.280
You may have nothing to show for it.

18:19.360 --> 18:20.600
Turn back while you still can.

18:20.680 --> 18:22.360
I wanted to turn back too.

18:24.080 --> 18:25.640
But I struggled with it for so long.

18:26.160 --> 18:27.480
I finally realized

18:29.680 --> 18:30.920
I could no longer turn back.

18:31.960 --> 18:33.400
Luckily, I never leave things half done.

18:34.000 --> 18:37.080
However difficult this path may be,
I'll follow it to the end.

18:38.480 --> 18:39.480
Very well.

18:40.040 --> 18:41.240
Take good care of her.

18:47.960 --> 18:49.280
Thank you, Grandmother.

18:49.800 --> 18:50.680
I'll remember it.

19:08.800 --> 19:11.000
My Lady, Lady Li urgently
summoned you to the palace.

19:11.080 --> 19:12.480
I wonder what she wants.

19:22.040 --> 19:22.920
Greetings, Your Majesty.

19:23.840 --> 19:26.720
Noble Lady Wu'an, you're in quite a hurry.

19:26.800 --> 19:27.880
Where are you going?

19:27.960 --> 19:31.160
Your Majesty, Lady Li has summoned me.

19:31.240 --> 19:32.440
-I'm on my way…
-Never mind who summoned you.

19:33.040 --> 19:35.520
Palace rules dictate
that all titled ladies visiting the palace

19:35.600 --> 19:38.200
must first pay
their respects to Her Majesty.

19:43.680 --> 19:45.040
I'm unfamiliar with palace rules.

19:45.560 --> 19:46.680
Please forgive me, Your Majesty.

19:47.640 --> 19:51.000
Perhaps you don't realize
how strict our palace rules are.

19:51.640 --> 19:53.960
Even a maid
who accidentally drops a jade cup

19:54.040 --> 19:57.120
must have her nose, lips,
and tongue cut off.

19:57.640 --> 19:59.560
Entering without
paying your respects to me

19:59.640 --> 20:02.040
shows grave disrespect
to the imperial family.

20:02.120 --> 20:05.640
Tell me, how should I punish you?

20:09.880 --> 20:13.760
I know you've suffered so many wrongs.

20:13.840 --> 20:17.440
But for now, you mustn't think of revenge.

20:21.880 --> 20:23.440
I've been rash and ignorant.

20:24.440 --> 20:26.280
Please show mercy, Your Majesty.

20:26.880 --> 20:27.960
Back then,

20:28.040 --> 20:30.160
you were so glib
before the Empress Dowager

20:30.240 --> 20:31.480
with all your clever arguments.

20:31.560 --> 20:33.480
At the tournament,
you humiliated me in front of everyone

20:33.560 --> 20:34.800
by refusing to marry.

20:34.880 --> 20:36.840
How smug and arrogant you were.

20:37.800 --> 20:38.680
What's this?

20:39.480 --> 20:43.880
One maid dies,
and you're scared out of your wits?

20:44.600 --> 20:47.760
Since you're young
and ignorant of the rules,

20:48.440 --> 20:50.840
your maid can take your punishment.

20:50.920 --> 20:52.600
Have mercy, Your Majesty! I was wrong!

20:52.680 --> 20:53.640
Have mercy, Your Majesty!

20:55.520 --> 20:58.600
-Your Majesty…
-How dare you look Her Majesty in the eye!

21:01.480 --> 21:03.960
Servants are punished
for their masters' mistakes.

21:04.040 --> 21:08.360
Even His Majesty
couldn't accuse me of being harsh.

21:09.120 --> 21:10.680
Noble Lady Wu'an,

21:12.400 --> 21:14.120
wouldn't you agree?

22:03.200 --> 22:04.640
I alone am at fault.

22:06.840 --> 22:08.120
My maid knew no better.

22:08.800 --> 22:12.680
Please, Your Majesty,
punish me and spare her.

22:25.440 --> 22:27.960
So you do know how to act obediently.

22:29.200 --> 22:32.200
You're much more perceptive
than your mother.

22:32.280 --> 22:34.520
Never forget how lowly you are.

22:35.480 --> 22:39.440
Know your place, and you'll live longer.

23:13.960 --> 23:15.640
ZHAOYANG PALACE

23:15.720 --> 23:17.560
My mother is worried about you.

23:17.640 --> 23:19.720
She wants you to stay with her
in Luoyang for a while.

23:20.400 --> 23:23.760
The capital may be prosperous,
but its scenery is no match for Luoyang's.

23:23.840 --> 23:24.680
SPLENDID AS BLOSSOMS

23:24.760 --> 23:27.680
If you leave now, you'll still be in time
for the Peony Festival.

23:28.480 --> 23:31.720
Everyone in the city, young and old,
will put flowers in their hair.

23:31.800 --> 23:33.960
Music will fill ancient temples
and grand homes.

23:34.040 --> 23:36.840
It'll be far more peaceful
and pleasant than here.

23:36.920 --> 23:38.440
I wish I could go with you.

23:39.760 --> 23:40.760
Rao,

23:41.800 --> 23:43.600
I'll have Shuo escort you.

23:43.680 --> 23:45.040
Would you like that?

23:48.720 --> 23:50.680
There's something
I want to ask Your Ladyship.

23:53.800 --> 23:55.360
Since you entered the palace,

23:55.880 --> 23:58.320
you've spent over a decade
striving for power.

24:00.400 --> 24:01.920
Don't you want to be Empress?

24:04.320 --> 24:06.040
-Rao…
-The one standing in your way

24:07.320 --> 24:08.600
is the Empress Dowager.

24:12.960 --> 24:15.360
The Empress
is the Empress Dowager's niece.

24:16.160 --> 24:18.520
Though she's jealous of others' talents
and unfit for her position,

24:19.720 --> 24:22.520
she's protected
by the Empress Dowager and the Han clan.

24:22.600 --> 24:24.480
Filial piety
is the foundation of our rule.

24:24.560 --> 24:26.440
His Majesty
cannot defy the Empress Dowager,

24:26.520 --> 24:29.280
so the Empress's position is unassailable.

24:30.040 --> 24:31.800
Apart from the Empress,

24:32.680 --> 24:37.960
the other powerful consorts
are Lady Zheng and Lady Wang.

24:40.040 --> 24:40.880
DEW AND BLOSSOMS

24:40.960 --> 24:43.800
Lady Zheng's father and brother
have both served as Grand Commandant.

24:43.880 --> 24:46.240
Her family is illustrious
and highly respected.

24:46.760 --> 24:48.000
Her son,

24:48.080 --> 24:50.440
Prince Duan, Liu Shou,
can wield both the pen and the sword.

24:51.080 --> 24:52.960
Compared with
the Empress's adopted son, Prince Jing,

24:53.040 --> 24:54.440
he has greater support
among court officials.

24:55.400 --> 24:57.840
His Majesty particularly favors him.

24:58.560 --> 24:59.560
AUSPICIOUS DAYS, JOYOUS GATHERINGS

24:59.640 --> 25:01.480
The Wang family
is wealthier than any other.

25:01.560 --> 25:02.520
When Lady Wang entered the palace,

25:03.120 --> 25:05.440
she gave His Majesty ten copper mines.

25:05.960 --> 25:09.200
She spent a billion coins on gifts
to her servants alone.

25:09.840 --> 25:11.680
Her son, Prince Fu, Liu Ding,

25:12.200 --> 25:14.400
is seeking a wife
whose family can bolster his position.

25:15.760 --> 25:17.640
The Empress
has the Empress Dowager's backing.

25:18.880 --> 25:22.400
Lady Zheng and Lady Wang
have either noble lineage or vast wealth,

25:23.120 --> 25:25.440
and their sons are highly capable.

25:25.520 --> 25:27.400
None of them is easy to contend with.

25:27.920 --> 25:30.520
-I don't want you dragged into this.
-But I already am.

25:36.160 --> 25:37.000
Is my sister here?

25:37.080 --> 25:38.000
I want to see her.

25:38.080 --> 25:38.920
Your…

25:39.840 --> 25:41.360
-Rao!
-You promised me, Your Ladyship,

25:42.080 --> 25:44.200
that I'd never be wronged again.

25:46.600 --> 25:47.560
She was only a maid.

25:48.360 --> 25:52.200
If you want, I can give you
a hundred or a thousand more.

25:52.280 --> 25:53.960
But you mustn't put yourself in danger.

25:54.040 --> 25:55.240
In your eyes,

25:55.840 --> 25:57.800
she was just a lowly maid.

25:59.360 --> 26:00.600
But she was the one

26:01.320 --> 26:03.800
who stayed with me through
my most uncertain and difficult days.

26:04.800 --> 26:05.840
To me,

26:06.560 --> 26:08.720
she was closer than you,

26:09.720 --> 26:10.960
my own birth mother.

26:18.160 --> 26:19.720
Do you still hate me?

26:25.120 --> 26:26.160
Mother.

26:29.040 --> 26:29.920
Mother.

26:31.800 --> 26:34.280
It's getting late.
Rao shouldn't stay in the palace too long.

26:34.360 --> 26:35.680
I'll escort her out.

26:35.760 --> 26:37.880
Tomorrow, you'll escort your grandmother
and your sister to Luoyang.

26:37.960 --> 26:39.360
I'm not going anywhere.

26:40.400 --> 26:41.880
I'm staying in the capital!

26:41.960 --> 26:43.840
Is it really wise to stay here?

26:43.920 --> 26:45.360
Wei Rao, stop right there!

26:48.680 --> 26:51.920
I'll settle this score sooner or later.

26:52.920 --> 26:54.120
She'll only complicate things by staying.

26:54.720 --> 26:55.840
Go persuade her.

26:55.920 --> 26:56.960
Make sure she leaves the capital soon.

27:05.040 --> 27:05.880
Rao.

27:05.960 --> 27:06.720
BAIHU HALL

27:06.800 --> 27:07.760
Rao.

27:08.680 --> 27:11.120
Rao, you shouldn't
have argued with Mother.

27:11.200 --> 27:12.360
She only wants what's best for you.

27:12.440 --> 27:13.440
Your Highness,

27:14.160 --> 27:15.720
look at my maid's face
before you say that.

27:17.720 --> 27:19.720
Must I really hide
in the countryside near Luoyang

27:19.800 --> 27:21.120
just to escape this danger?

27:21.200 --> 27:23.000
If you're angry, take it out on me.

27:23.080 --> 27:24.920
-As for Shou's meals and daily routine…
-How can you blame Mother?

27:25.680 --> 27:27.120
That's no way to show filial piety!

27:27.200 --> 27:28.920
You've always been the one
who's enjoyed Mother's love.

27:29.000 --> 27:30.960
I've never had any of it.

27:31.040 --> 27:31.920
Rao?

27:32.000 --> 27:34.440
You aren't the one
facing blades and arrows.

27:35.080 --> 27:36.280
No wonder you make it sound so easy.

27:36.360 --> 27:38.160
Even if you're jealous,

27:38.240 --> 27:40.680
you shouldn't make a scene in public
and damage Mother's reputation.

27:40.760 --> 27:42.560
You're coming with me.
I won't let you get away with this. Come!

27:42.640 --> 27:44.000
-Liu Shuo!
-Come on!

27:44.080 --> 27:44.800
Let go of me!

27:46.400 --> 27:47.800
-Rao!
-Go check on her.

27:49.080 --> 27:50.280
Rao!

27:52.600 --> 27:53.960
Come on. Careful.

27:55.320 --> 27:56.600
Are you hurt?

27:57.400 --> 27:58.400
Liu Shuo, how dare you!

27:59.000 --> 28:00.600
No wonder His Majesty
is always scolding you for being rash.

28:01.240 --> 28:02.560
This is disgraceful.

28:02.640 --> 28:05.840
I'll be sure to tell His Majesty
and have you properly punished.

28:14.920 --> 28:16.160
My dear,

28:16.720 --> 28:18.640
you can't leave the palace
looking like this.

28:19.360 --> 28:21.120
People will talk.

28:21.720 --> 28:24.960
Why don't you come to my chambers
and tidy yourself up?

28:25.040 --> 28:27.480
Then I'll have your cousin
escort you home.

28:30.160 --> 28:31.000
Come on.

28:49.040 --> 28:50.400
DEW AND BLOSSOMS

28:50.480 --> 28:52.600
Of all His Majesty's children,

28:53.320 --> 28:55.800
Liu Shuo is the most unruly.

28:56.680 --> 28:59.640
He's like a wild horse,

29:00.200 --> 29:02.480
with no talent for letters or arms.

29:03.000 --> 29:04.880
His Majesty has
admonished him time and again,

29:04.960 --> 29:05.800
but he never changes.

29:06.840 --> 29:10.280
You are a forgiving girl.

29:10.960 --> 29:13.160
Don't hold it against him.

29:14.000 --> 29:16.280
He and I were born of the same mother,

29:16.800 --> 29:18.840
yet my cousin Shu cares for me more.

29:20.120 --> 29:22.560
I thought that
once I found my birth mother,

29:22.640 --> 29:24.200
I'd have someone to protect me.

29:25.200 --> 29:29.000
I never imagined
she'd refuse to stand up for me too.

29:29.760 --> 29:32.120
Perhaps Lady Li has her reasons.

29:35.240 --> 29:39.800
Your cousin has told me
the whole story of your birth.

29:41.000 --> 29:42.160
What I don't understand is,

29:42.760 --> 29:45.320
are wealth and power really worth so much?

29:46.000 --> 29:49.880
How could a mother
bear to see her own daughter

29:50.720 --> 29:52.720
treated so cruelly?

29:53.520 --> 29:55.280
She's far too heartless.

29:55.360 --> 29:57.720
If I had a sweet,
lovely daughter like you,

29:59.600 --> 30:02.720
why, I could never love her enough.

30:03.280 --> 30:04.720
I could only dream of having one.

30:05.880 --> 30:07.160
From now on,

30:07.680 --> 30:10.800
if anyone wrongs you,
come straight to my chambers.

30:11.400 --> 30:13.440
I can at least offer you some comfort.

30:25.560 --> 30:28.000
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

30:28.080 --> 30:29.080
Careful.

30:30.720 --> 30:31.560
My Lord.

30:33.320 --> 30:34.560
You must be tired.

30:36.080 --> 30:37.400
-Take care.
-See you next time.

30:38.000 --> 30:38.800
Who was visiting?

30:38.880 --> 30:40.680
Someone from the Qi family,
the Marquis of Pingxi's household.

30:42.520 --> 30:43.720
Fresh vegetables!

30:43.800 --> 30:44.640
Please make way.

30:44.720 --> 30:46.160
Get your fresh greens!

30:47.360 --> 30:49.360
-Here you are, sir.
-Thanks.

30:49.440 --> 30:52.240
What? He really went?

30:52.320 --> 30:54.360
Of course. Plenty of people saw him.

30:55.800 --> 30:57.280
Good!

30:58.840 --> 30:59.680
Good!

30:59.760 --> 31:00.600
BENEVOLENCE SPREADS FAR AND WIDE

31:10.360 --> 31:12.720
What's made you so happy, Grandmother?

31:13.240 --> 31:14.120
You're beaming.

31:14.200 --> 31:20.320
Wanniang, tell your dear son
why the Qi family came to visit.

31:20.400 --> 31:24.400
The Marquis of Pingxi wishes to marry

31:24.480 --> 31:26.160
Noble Lady Wu'an on Zhongkai's behalf.

31:26.240 --> 31:30.240
Out of respect for the long friendship
between our families,

31:30.320 --> 31:33.440
they came to sound us out first.

31:33.520 --> 31:34.920
What?

31:35.000 --> 31:36.800
Don't worry. Actually…

31:36.880 --> 31:39.400
Actually, they were worrying over nothing.

31:39.480 --> 31:42.080
Lu Zhuo is so magnanimous.

31:42.160 --> 31:46.280
Even if Wei Rao marries General Qi,
he'll have no objection.

31:46.360 --> 31:50.600
After all, one is the ex-wife of an
convenience marriage just to bring luck.

31:50.680 --> 31:53.720
The other is a brother-in-arms
who's faced death alongside him.

31:53.800 --> 31:55.280
If they tie the knot…

31:55.360 --> 31:56.520
Did you agree to it too, Grandmother?

31:57.280 --> 32:00.200
As long as Wei Rao is willing,

32:00.280 --> 32:04.400
even Lady Li would have no objection.

32:04.480 --> 32:07.320
Who am I, an outsider, to have a say?

32:10.360 --> 32:11.640
Zhuo! Lu Zhuo!

32:11.720 --> 32:13.040
Where are you going?

32:14.840 --> 32:17.320
Mother, why must you tease him?

32:17.400 --> 32:21.240
When the Qi family came to sound us out,
didn't you send them away?

32:21.320 --> 32:22.400
You never agreed to anything.

32:23.000 --> 32:26.520
He acts so hard-hearted
and stubborn in public,

32:26.600 --> 32:28.680
then secretly goes and plows her fields.

32:28.760 --> 32:30.200
Even kept it from his own family.

32:30.280 --> 32:32.560
Look how anxious he is now.

32:33.800 --> 32:34.640
Serves him right!

32:37.000 --> 32:37.840
Bravo!

32:50.640 --> 32:53.880
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

32:54.880 --> 32:55.720
You may all leave.

32:55.800 --> 32:57.640
CAISHU HALL

32:58.280 --> 32:59.600
Why have they stopped?

33:00.960 --> 33:04.560
Even the finest performance is pointless
if no one appreciates it.

33:06.680 --> 33:10.280
Wei Rao, what's troubling you
that you can't tell me?

33:14.640 --> 33:19.480
A lowly night-soil woman
is now Noble Lady Wu'an,

33:20.680 --> 33:23.040
with a generous stipend and a fief.

33:24.120 --> 33:25.840
It's what so many people dream of.

33:27.120 --> 33:28.840
What more could I want?

33:37.360 --> 33:38.200
Wei Rao,

33:39.920 --> 33:41.240
I want to marry you.

33:44.320 --> 33:45.160
You…

33:45.680 --> 33:46.640
I know, to protect yourself,

33:46.720 --> 33:49.320
you've had to keep
both Lu Zhuo and me on your side.

33:50.800 --> 33:53.200
I'm happy to help you,

33:53.280 --> 33:55.680
but I wish I have met you earlier.

33:56.680 --> 33:58.040
Alone at midnight,

33:58.120 --> 34:00.000
I used to lie awake,
thinking over and over.

34:00.800 --> 34:03.640
If you truly loved each other
and were truly husband and wife,

34:06.040 --> 34:07.480
however much it hurt,

34:08.920 --> 34:09.960
I could hide my feelings.

34:11.000 --> 34:12.600
But he actually let you go.

34:13.239 --> 34:15.400
Clearly, you meant nothing to him.

34:16.239 --> 34:18.320
Only then, I feel I can confess
what is in my heart.

34:21.320 --> 34:24.800
General Qi, you don't really know me.

34:24.880 --> 34:28.440
Before I met you,
I didn't even know myself.

34:30.239 --> 34:32.040
I foolishly pictured my future wife,

34:32.920 --> 34:36.800
hoping she'd be gentle, virtuous,
poised, and gracious.

34:37.560 --> 34:39.040
But once I met you,

34:39.960 --> 34:41.639
I can no longer picture her
as anyone else.

34:47.840 --> 34:49.320
What if I say no?

34:51.639 --> 34:54.280
If you say yes,
I'll do everything I can to keep you safe.

34:54.360 --> 34:55.600
If you say no,

34:56.120 --> 34:57.640
it means I haven't done enough.

34:58.200 --> 35:00.120
I'll try a hundred,
even a thousand times harder.

35:01.600 --> 35:06.160
Even when my hair turns gray
and my teeth loosen with age,

35:08.000 --> 35:09.520
I'll be waiting for you to say yes.

35:24.200 --> 35:27.320
FLOURISHING LIKE THE PINES

35:37.240 --> 35:38.280
Rao,

35:38.800 --> 35:40.320
the proprieties come before everything.

35:40.840 --> 35:42.960
Even I have to bow to them.

35:43.800 --> 35:45.320
You must do the same.

35:47.680 --> 35:49.200
Never forget how lowly you are.

35:50.520 --> 35:53.720
Know your place, and you'll live longer.

35:54.360 --> 35:55.560
The proprieties?

35:57.520 --> 36:00.040
I know nothing of them.

36:02.000 --> 36:04.920
All I know is debts must be paid,
and murderers must die.

36:05.880 --> 36:07.800
She holds human life so cheap.

36:09.120 --> 36:11.360
She's unfit to be Empress.

36:13.880 --> 36:16.600
However high she sits as Empress,

36:17.240 --> 36:21.440
I'll drag her down from her throne.

36:23.840 --> 36:25.000
It's Jinzi.

36:25.080 --> 36:26.040
It's running all over the place again.

36:29.520 --> 36:30.360
Bring it here.

36:33.800 --> 36:34.840
Yes.

36:43.480 --> 36:44.600
Come out!

36:44.680 --> 36:45.640
Jinzi!

36:45.720 --> 36:47.040
CAISHU HALL

36:47.120 --> 36:48.360
Jinzi?

36:50.400 --> 36:51.440
Jinzi?

36:52.640 --> 36:53.800
Come out, you wretched dog!

36:53.880 --> 36:55.080
What's wrong?

36:55.600 --> 36:57.560
That stupid, filthy dog
ran off with my earring.

36:57.640 --> 36:58.880
Go catch it.

36:58.960 --> 37:00.800
Lord Lu gave that dog to Her Ladyship.

37:00.880 --> 37:01.840
She adores it.

37:01.920 --> 37:02.760
How can you…?

37:02.840 --> 37:04.160
Don't use Her Ladyship's name
to pressure me.

37:04.920 --> 37:05.880
All of you, go look for the dog.

37:05.960 --> 37:06.920
Catch that dog right now!

37:08.480 --> 37:09.720
That wretched dog.

37:11.080 --> 37:11.920
Gejin!

37:12.000 --> 37:13.000
Come out, you wretched dog!

37:13.880 --> 37:14.800
Jinzi!

37:32.680 --> 37:34.320
How dare you sneak in here
so late at night?

37:46.160 --> 37:47.000
What?

37:48.120 --> 37:51.520
Qi Zhongkai can visit, but I can't?

37:52.040 --> 37:52.880
How dare you!

38:33.400 --> 38:35.360
Guards!

38:42.600 --> 38:45.920
Everyone knows
Lord Lu is honorable and upright,

38:46.000 --> 38:47.880
a true gentleman.

38:47.960 --> 38:49.240
Yet you sneaked
into a lady's chamber at night.

38:49.840 --> 38:51.760
Aren't you afraid
it'll ruin your reputation?

38:55.600 --> 38:57.320
Why are you laughing?
Have you lost your mind?

39:02.640 --> 39:05.000
Go ahead. Call everyone here.

39:05.800 --> 39:07.200
Let the whole world know

39:07.280 --> 39:10.920
Noble Lady Wu'an and her former husband
are having a midnight tryst.

39:11.000 --> 39:12.960
-You…!
-Your Ladyship!

39:14.080 --> 39:15.160
Your Ladyship!

39:15.880 --> 39:16.720
Your Ladyship!

39:17.320 --> 39:19.200
Your Ladyship, where's the intruder?

39:21.280 --> 39:24.280
It's night, and the candlelight is dim.

39:24.360 --> 39:25.680
My eyes played tricks on me.

39:25.760 --> 39:27.440
I mistook a tree's shadow for a person.

39:27.520 --> 39:28.520
All is well. You may leave.

39:29.160 --> 39:30.000
-Yes.
-Yes.

39:33.240 --> 39:35.680
Lu Zhuo, why won't you leave me alone?

39:38.640 --> 39:42.920
I've come to talk
to Your Ladyship about a deal.

39:44.400 --> 39:45.240
What kind of deal?

39:46.320 --> 39:48.000
The Empress schemed
to force you into marriage

39:48.080 --> 39:48.960
and killed your beloved maid.

39:49.640 --> 39:52.360
Knowing you, you must hate her bitterly

39:53.800 --> 39:55.520
and be desperate for revenge.

40:00.320 --> 40:01.400
Go on.

40:03.680 --> 40:05.720
Han Liao conspired with the Huta.

40:05.800 --> 40:06.880
He leaked military secrets,

40:07.400 --> 40:10.480
nearly killing me
and costing me soldiers and officers.

40:11.480 --> 40:13.280
I won't rest until he's dead.

40:14.840 --> 40:18.680
If the Han clan is our common enemy,

40:38.760 --> 40:40.360
why shouldn't we work together?

40:41.480 --> 40:44.960
Qi Zhongkai can't help you
achieve what you want.

40:46.040 --> 40:48.240
He still answers
to his father and elder brother.

40:49.000 --> 40:51.160
Neither in the Marquis
of Pingxi's household nor in the army

40:52.640 --> 40:54.240
does he have the final say.

40:55.760 --> 40:57.000
I'm different.

41:05.320 --> 41:06.320
In all the world,

41:07.120 --> 41:09.560
I'm the only one who knows what you want.

41:11.920 --> 41:13.200
And I'm the only one

41:14.240 --> 41:16.120
who can help you get it,

41:19.240 --> 41:20.080
Wei Rao.

41:22.400 --> 41:23.640
Why?

41:24.400 --> 41:25.960
Don't hesitate any longer.

41:26.840 --> 41:28.680
I have everything you want.

41:30.720 --> 41:33.520
If you need me, just come to me.

41:35.600 --> 41:37.040
I'd do it gladly.

41:40.720 --> 41:43.680
You came all this way
just to tell me that?

41:46.080 --> 41:47.320
I had to.

41:48.160 --> 41:50.000
I was afraid someone
would offer you a little favor,

41:51.320 --> 41:52.920
and you'd run off with him.

41:55.240 --> 41:56.080
There.

41:56.600 --> 41:57.520
It's your turn to choose.

42:13.600 --> 42:15.200
Do I even have a choice?

42:43.360 --> 42:44.720
Where on earth is it hiding?

42:46.480 --> 42:47.680
That wretched dog.

43:04.320 --> 43:05.320
Chilan.

43:06.360 --> 43:07.720
Have you found Jinzi?

43:08.240 --> 43:09.080
Chilan!

43:12.280 --> 43:13.200
Gejin.

43:13.960 --> 43:15.960
What's wrong? You look so pale.

43:16.560 --> 43:18.800
I'm fine. I'm just terrified of the dark.

43:18.880 --> 43:20.240
Have you seen Jinzi?

43:20.320 --> 43:22.200
I thought I heard Jinzi just now.

43:23.120 --> 43:25.160
But then it was gone again.

43:26.000 --> 43:27.040
Right.

43:28.720 --> 43:29.560
Gejin.

43:48.920 --> 43:49.960
Jinzi!

43:51.480 --> 43:52.360
Jinzi?

44:27.840 --> 44:30.040
How do you propose we form this alliance?

44:30.120 --> 44:32.360
You're fickle and cast people aside
once they've served their purpose.

44:32.440 --> 44:34.560
I can't trust you, unless…

44:34.640 --> 44:35.800
Unless what?

44:35.880 --> 44:39.880
Unless we remarry
and become husband and wife again.

44:43.800 --> 44:46.080
Then you'll have to prove

44:47.520 --> 44:49.080
what you're capable of first.

44:55.480 --> 44:56.560
Where's Chilan?

44:58.920 --> 45:01.760
Oh, that girl. The day's just started,

45:01.840 --> 45:03.200
and she's already off
somewhere shirking her duties.

45:04.640 --> 45:05.720
She's not like that.

45:07.200 --> 45:08.200
You needn't attend to me.

45:08.800 --> 45:09.960
Go and look for Chilan.

45:10.560 --> 45:11.400
-Yes.
-Yes.

45:19.600 --> 45:20.840
I'll go at once.

45:30.960 --> 45:33.640
I remember giving you
a gold necklace set with sapphires.

45:34.160 --> 45:36.040
Later, when you pawned your jewelry,

45:36.120 --> 45:37.680
you picked out that piece
and returned it to me.

45:38.200 --> 45:39.400
I thought perhaps you didn't like it.

45:39.480 --> 45:43.120
So I had a finer one made for you.

45:44.040 --> 45:45.080
See if you like this one.

45:46.120 --> 45:47.720
General Qi, the truth is…

45:47.800 --> 45:49.840
If you're going to turn it down,
please don't say it.

45:50.440 --> 45:52.200
If you want a husband
to join your household,

45:52.280 --> 45:53.880
I have an elder brother,

45:53.960 --> 45:56.320
so marrying into your family
would be no problem.

45:57.440 --> 45:59.240
Lu Zhuo is the Duke's heir, though.

45:59.320 --> 46:00.160
Can he do that?

46:00.240 --> 46:01.880
Such groveling, General Qi.

46:01.960 --> 46:03.360
Aren't you afraid
your father will die of anger?

46:07.320 --> 46:09.880
I knew you'd be scheming
behind my back again.

46:09.960 --> 46:12.360
Your Ladyship, don't fall for his tricks.

46:12.920 --> 46:14.200
He's been like this since childhood.

46:14.720 --> 46:17.160
Now, he seems modest and easygoing,

46:17.240 --> 46:19.600
but behind closed doors,
he's full of tricks and schemes.

46:19.680 --> 46:20.800
Behind closed doors?

46:21.320 --> 46:22.240
As if you haven't played
your share of tricks.

46:22.840 --> 46:24.400
I'm honest and aboveboard.

46:25.080 --> 46:26.160
What tricks have I played?

46:34.320 --> 46:37.680
Do you think Wei Rao is that shallow?

46:40.840 --> 46:42.000
You're one to talk.

46:42.080 --> 46:43.560
Don't think I don't know
you've been watching her,

46:43.640 --> 46:44.560
trying to win her over by staying close.

46:45.320 --> 46:46.200
You can't hide it from me.

46:46.840 --> 46:47.680
Your Ladyship!

46:50.520 --> 46:52.080
Your Ladyship,
something terrible has happened.

46:59.560 --> 47:00.520
Her Ladyship is here.

47:07.440 --> 47:09.440
Chilan!

47:12.440 --> 47:13.560
Chilan…

47:15.040 --> 47:15.880
What happened?

47:15.960 --> 47:18.000
Someone fetching water
found her in the river this morning.

47:18.800 --> 47:21.160
She may have slipped and fallen in.

47:22.400 --> 47:24.120
Pull her out of the way.

47:28.040 --> 47:30.040
Chilan!

47:44.880 --> 47:45.880
Nothing between her fingers.

47:46.560 --> 47:48.800
-No sand or waterweeds.
-Nothing in her mouth either.

47:49.960 --> 47:51.160
What does that mean?

47:52.480 --> 47:55.200
If she'd been alive when she fell in,
she would have struggled,

47:55.280 --> 47:58.000
and there'd usually be weeds or sand
lodged between her fingers.

47:58.720 --> 47:59.600
Unless…

48:00.560 --> 48:02.520
Unless someone threw her
into the river after she was dead.

48:12.160 --> 48:13.760
What happened here?

48:13.840 --> 48:14.720
Who did this?

48:14.800 --> 48:15.600
Who could've done this?

48:15.680 --> 48:19.080
Without my permission,
no one here is to leave.

48:19.160 --> 48:20.840
How could this happen?

48:20.920 --> 48:22.120
Who did this?

48:22.720 --> 48:24.480
-How could she end up here?
-Right.

48:28.880 --> 48:29.920
It's Jinzi.

48:50.640 --> 48:51.760
What's wrong?

48:51.840 --> 48:54.280
That silly girl lost the jade bracelet
Your Ladyship gave her.

48:54.360 --> 48:55.440
She cried all last night.

48:55.520 --> 48:56.920
How embarrassing.

49:01.160 --> 49:02.200
Here.

49:02.280 --> 49:04.240
This is to replace it. Don't cry.

49:05.240 --> 49:06.080
Thank you, Your Ladyship.

49:07.800 --> 49:09.040
It belonged to Chilan.

49:09.800 --> 49:11.080
Why is it near the cellar?

49:11.720 --> 49:13.800
Bring me all the workers who've been
digging the cellar over the past ten days.

49:14.360 --> 49:15.560
-Yes.
-Yes.

49:45.200 --> 49:47.160
I'm innocent, My Lord!

49:52.160 --> 49:53.120
It was you?

49:53.200 --> 49:54.440
It wasn't me.

49:54.520 --> 49:55.800
It really wasn't me!

49:58.560 --> 50:00.600
I'm innocent, My Lord!

50:00.680 --> 50:01.520
How dare he?

50:01.600 --> 50:03.240
How could anyone do such a thing?

50:03.320 --> 50:04.760
How could he commit such an murder?

50:04.840 --> 50:06.240
How could he do that?

50:06.320 --> 50:08.840
Lu Zhuo, I leave this man to you.

50:08.920 --> 50:11.040
Whatever methods you use,

50:12.080 --> 50:13.520
before sunset today,

50:15.120 --> 50:17.960
I want to know why he killed Chilan,
who'd done nothing wrong.

50:18.560 --> 50:19.480
There's no need to wait till sunset.

50:19.560 --> 50:20.400
-He was nice fellow, but why?
-Indeed.

50:20.480 --> 50:22.880
-I'll have your answer within an hour.
-How could he do such a thing?

52:34.080 --> 52:36.640
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
